{"3827830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The DeadLine", "steam_appid": 3827830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>“This is the last train. And you are its only passenger.”</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, the world became overrun by the undead.<br>You boarded the final subway still in operation, bound for a single destination: <strong>City Hall</strong>, where your family might still be waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this train isn’t just your escape—it’s a gauntlet. At every station, you’ll face ravenous hordes of zombies. Only by activating the fuse at each stop within the time limit can you move on. Fail… and a brutal fight for survival awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The DeadLine</strong> is a first-person survival FPS set in a zombie apocalypse,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > where every station brings new tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Face a relentless clock, grow stronger with roguelike upgrades, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and immerse yourself in addictive, high-stakes gunplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinctive Weapon System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>Normal</strong>, <strong>Epic</strong>, and <strong>Legendary</strong> firearms—each delivering a perfect blend of realism and fun.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827830/extras/b8186d9501331c3a0fe960b7314ffb74.poster.avif?t=1784345805\" width=614 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827830/extras/b8186d9501331c3a0fe960b7314ffb74.webm?t=1784345805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827830/extras/b8186d9501331c3a0fe960b7314ffb74.mp4?t=1784345805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827830/extras/f6e537c0c754ade068aded168ea7467d.poster.avif?t=1784345805\" width=614 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827830/extras/f6e537c0c754ade068aded168ea7467d.webm?t=1784345805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827830/extras/f6e537c0c754ade068aded168ea7467d.mp4?t=1784345805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race Against the Clock</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your mission at each station and return to the train before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827830/extras/4f6bf623aca6dd8369000f5ebaec3875.poster.avif?t=1784345805\" width=614 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827830/extras/4f6bf623aca6dd8369000f5ebaec3875.webm?t=1784345805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827830/extras/4f6bf623aca6dd8369000f5ebaec3875.mp4?t=1784345805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unstoppable Zombie Hordes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One second too late, and waves of undead from previous stations will overwhelm you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827830/extras/6a242592c9f144810448848aeb0dca60.poster.avif?t=1784345805\" width=614 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827830/extras/6a242592c9f144810448848aeb0dca60.webm?t=1784345805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827830/extras/6a242592c9f144810448848aeb0dca60.mp4?t=1784345805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Chips &amp; Upgrades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>Skill Chips</strong> during combat to unlock powerful abilities and customize your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827830/extras/5846b379744b5330945c9b3afd3168db.poster.avif?t=1784345805\" width=614 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827830/extras/5846b379744b5330945c9b3afd3168db.webm?t=1784345805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827830/extras/5846b379744b5330945c9b3afd3168db.mp4?t=1784345805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode Leaderboards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with other players in <strong>Endless Mode</strong>, climb the global rankings, and prove you’re the best.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>“May the odds always be in your favor.”</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The train departs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your desperate fight for survival.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>“This is the last train. And you are its only passenger.”</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, the world became overrun by the undead.<br>You boarded the final subway still in operation, bound for a single destination: <strong>City Hall</strong>, where your family might still be waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this train isn’t just your escape—it’s a gauntlet. At every station, you’ll face ravenous hordes of zombies. Only by activating the fuse at each stop within the time limit can you move on. Fail… and a brutal fight for survival awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The DeadLine</strong> is a first-person survival FPS set in a zombie apocalypse,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > where every station brings new tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Face a relentless clock, grow stronger with roguelike upgrades, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and immerse yourself in addictive, high-stakes gunplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinctive Weapon System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>Normal</strong>, <strong>Epic</strong>, and <strong>Legendary</strong> firearms—each delivering a perfect blend of realism and fun.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827830/extras/b8186d9501331c3a0fe960b7314ffb74.poster.avif?t=1784345805\" width=614 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827830/extras/b8186d9501331c3a0fe960b7314ffb74.webm?t=1784345805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827830/extras/b8186d9501331c3a0fe960b7314ffb74.mp4?t=1784345805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsi